    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659690/extras/11957e6affcffe93a7868a3794fca13f.avif?t=1754148678\" width=640 height=180 /></span>\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25b6 OPERATION ATHENA FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive and Impactful Gunplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Leaning System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bold and Engaging AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad Specific Player Classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elimination Game Mode (Terrorist Hunt)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hostage Rescue Game Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomb Threat Game Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operations in Locations around the Globe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>More Coming Soon!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659690/extras/391b228e27a6947ead188f42e8044a4f.poster.avif?t=1754148678\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659690/extras/391b228e27a6947ead188f42e8044a4f.webm?t=1754148678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659690/extras/391b228e27a6947ead188f42e8044a4f.mp4?t=1754148678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Class system:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In Operation Athena you will play as one of four distinct operators. Each member is vital to mission success.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Team Leader:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Team Leader is an important member of the squad, the team leader designates roles, outlines mission plans and coordinates team movements.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659690/extras/b955ab2ccdf07d8a1fca038a5d82cfbe.avif?t=1754148678\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u25b6 Medic:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Medic is responsible for providing medical support to injured teammates and ensuring the squad's survivability during combat engagements. The Medic will utilize equipment to render aid to injured team members.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659690/extras/e77f66bf64f3ff366d74111003f2fbe3.avif?t=1754148678\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u25b6 Support Gunner:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The Support Gunner specializes in providing suppressive fire and firepower support to the team. The Support Gunner will carry additional ammunition to reinforce the team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659690/extras/36cbb8c80006bae2e9e2d461945c352e.avif?t=1754148678\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span>\u25b6 Breacher:</h2></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Breacher is tasked with gaining entry into fortified or barricaded enemy positions. The Breacher will utilize a shotgun and will also be equipped with additional explosives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659690/extras/8f16018ffb03e1749bb9f10effd0e82b.avif?t=1754148678\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span>\u00a0 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659690/extras/11957e6affcffe93a7868a3794fca13f.avif?t=1754148678\" width=640 height=180 /></span>\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25b6 OPERATION ATHENA FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive and Impactful Gunplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Leaning System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bold and Engaging AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squad Specific Player Classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elimination Game Mode (Terrorist Hunt)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hostage Rescue Game Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomb Threat Game Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operations in Locations around the Globe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>More Coming Soon!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659690/extras/391b228e27a6947ead188f42e8044a4f.poster.avif?t=1754148678\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659690/extras/391b228e27a6947ead188f42e8044a4f.webm?t=1754148678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659690/extras/391b228e27a6947ead188f42e8044a4f.mp4?t=1754148678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Class system:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In Operation Athena you will play as one of four distinct operators. Each member is vital to mission success.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Team Leader:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Team Leader is an important member of the squad, the team leader designates roles, outlines mission plans and coordinates team movements.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659690/extras/b955ab2ccdf07d8a1fca038a5d82cfbe.avif?t=1754148678\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u25b6 Medic:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Medic is responsible for providing medical support to injured teammates and ensuring the squad's survivability during combat engagements. The Medic will utilize equipment to render aid to injured team members.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659690/extras/e77f66bf64f3ff366d74111003f2fbe3.avif?t=1754148678\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u25b6 Support Gunner:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The Support Gunner specializes in providing suppressive fire and firepower support to the team. The Support Gunner will carry additional ammunition to reinforce the team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659690/extras/36cbb8c80006bae2e9e2d461945c352e.avif?t=1754148678\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span>\u25b6 Breacher:</h2></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Breacher is tasked with gaining entry into fortified or barricaded enemy positions. The Breacher will utilize a shotgun and will also be equipped with additional explosives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659690/extras/8f16018ffb03e1749bb9f10effd0e82b.avif?t=1754148678\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span>\u00a0 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b\u2e3b</p>",
